Vendored and modified Rust crates (vendor/, see vendor/README.md)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following crates are copies of their crates.io releases, MODIFIED for AgentFX.
Every change is marked with a "reel patch" comment (git grep -n -F "reel patch" vendor).

- blitz-dom 0.3.0-beta.4      https://github.com/dioxuslabs/blitz
  MIT OR Apache-2.0           vendor/blitz-dom/LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE
- blitz-paint 0.3.0-beta.4    https://github.com/dioxuslabs/blitz
  MIT OR Apache-2.0           vendor/blitz-paint/LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE
- parley 0.12.0               https://github.com/linebender/parley
  Apache-2.0 OR MIT           vendor/parley/LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-MIT
- stylo 0.22.0                https://github.com/servo/stylo
  MPL-2.0                     vendor/stylo/LICENSE
  Stylo is under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, a file-level copyleft licence. The
  modified files remain under MPL-2.0 and their source, including the modifications,
  is available in vendor/stylo/. Per-file MPL headers are kept.

Files bundled inside the vendored crates:

- vendor/blitz-dom/assets/moz-bullet-font.otf ("Mozilla Bullet", from Firefox), shipped
  unchanged by upstream blitz-dom. The file carries no licence string; as part of the
  Firefox sources it is treated as MPL-2.0.
- vendor/stylo/properties/vendored_python/: Mako 1.3.10 (MIT), toml 0.10.2 (MIT) and
  MarkupSafe (BSD-3-Clause), used for build-time code generation; their licence texts
