Fonts (OFL-1.1)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

assets/fonts/ bundles Fraunces, Inter, JetBrains Mono, Libre Franklin, Noto Sans Mono,
Nunito, Source Serif 4 and Space Grotesk, unmodified, under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1. Copyright notices and the licence text: assets/fonts/OFL.txt; versions
and upstream sources: assets/fonts/README.md. "Source" is a Reserved Font Name of
Adobe. The copies of Inter in examples/scenes/ are under the same licence (OFL.txt
next to them).

