------------------------------------------------------------------------------
External programs (not bundled)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AgentFX calls ffmpeg, and optionally piper (GPL-3.0), Chrome/Playwright and
faster-whisper, as separate programs. They are not part of this distribution.
